      <div class="col-headers">
        <div class="col-h">✓</div>
        <div class="col-h">Task</div>
        <div class="col-h">Priority</div>
        <div class="col-h">Notes / Frequency</div>
      </div>
      <div class="week-body">
        <div class="task-item">
          <div class="task-cell checkbox"><input type="checkbox"></div>
          <div class="task-cell label">
            File annual Spanish tax return (declaración de la renta)
            <span class="task-desc">If tax resident in Spain (183+ days in the year).</span>
          </div>
          <div class="task-cell deadline-col"><span class="tag tag-legal">ANNUAL</span><span style="font-size:0.7rem; color: var(--muted);">April–June</span></div>
          <div class="task-cell notes">Via Agencia Tributaria (AEAT) website using digital certificate. Deadline is 30 June each year for the previous tax year. File Modelo 100 (standard income tax). Modelo 720 for foreign assets over €50,000 (once only, report increases annually).</div>
        </div>
        <div class="task-item">
          <div class="task-cell checkbox"><input type="checkbox"></div>
          <div class="task-cell label">
            Renew TIE card before expiry
            <span class="task-desc">TIE cards expire — check your expiry date and renew 60 days before.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="task-cell deadline-col"><span class="tag tag-legal">BEFORE EXPIRY</span></div>
          <div class="task-cell notes">Apply via cita previa at your local Oficina de Extranjería. Bring current TIE, passport, updated padrón, updated financial evidence, and health insurance certificate.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="task-item">
          <div class="task-cell checkbox"><input type="checkbox"></div>
          <div class="task-cell label">
            Renew health insurance policy annually
            <span class="task-desc">Policy must remain valid throughout your residency. Do not let it lapse.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="task-cell deadline-col"><span class="tag tag-important">ANNUAL</span></div>
          <div class="task-cell notes">Review policy at renewal — compare providers for cost and coverage. Ensure continued no-copay compliance for visa renewal purposes.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="task-item">
          <div class="task-cell checkbox"><input type="checkbox"></div>
          <div class="task-cell label">
            Update padrón if you move address
            <span class="task-desc">Padrón must always reflect your actual current address.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="task-cell deadline-col"><span class="tag tag-legal">ON MOVE</span></div>
          <div class="task-cell notes">Failure to maintain an accurate padrón can affect TIE renewal and access to services. Update within 2 weeks of any move.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="task-item">
          <div class="task-cell checkbox"><input type="checkbox"></div>
          <div class="task-cell label">
            File Modelo 720 (foreign asset declaration) if you hold over €50,000 in assets abroad
            <span class="task-desc">Annual obligation for Spanish tax residents with significant foreign assets.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="task-cell deadline-col"><span class="tag tag-legal">ANNUAL</span><span style="font-size:0.7rem; color: var(--muted);">By 31 March</span></div>
          <div class="task-cell notes">Covers foreign bank accounts, property, and investments. Penalties for non-compliance are severe. Consult an asesor fiscal if you have overseas assets above the threshold.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="task-item">
          <div class="task-cell checkbox"><input type="checkbox"></div>
          <div class="task-cell label">
            Track days in Spain for 183-day rule (NLV holders)
            <span class="task-desc">NLV holders must spend 183+ days per year in Spain to maintain tax residency and visa validity.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="task-cell deadline-col"><span class="tag tag-nlv">NLV</span></div>
          <div class="task-cell notes">Keep a simple log of entry/exit dates. Your passport stamps are evidence. Exceeding 6 months abroad in a calendar year can jeopardise your NLV renewal.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

